    "q-106813": {
      "dom_id": "step-q106813",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Let $F$ be the set of functions $f:R\\to R$ such that $f(0)=\\frac{1}{2}.$ Complete the following sentence:\n\n*$F$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication of a function by a real number) because $\\text{_________}\\,.$*",
      "worked_solution": "The correct answer is as follows:\n\n*$F$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication of a function by a real number) because **$F$ does not contain the zero element.** *\n\nIndeed, evaluating the zero function $f(x)=0$ at $x=0,$ we have $f(0)=0\\ne \\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nOn the other hand:\n\n- Addition of $f,g\\in F$ is associative. $\\,✓$\n\n- Addition of $f,g\\in F$ is commutative. $\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\cdot f=f$ for all $f\\in F.$ $\\,✓$\n\n- Addition and scalar multiplication of functions satisfy the distributive laws. $\\,✓$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-106813-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "$F$ does not contain the zero element",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"76\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> does not contain the zero element"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-106813-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "addition of $f,g\\in F$ is not associative",
              "html": "addition of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"77\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is not associative"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-106813-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "$1\\cdot f\\ne f$ for some $f\\in F$",
